/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on option values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - set        — boolean flag indicating whether the option contains a value
 *   - hasError   — boolean flag indicating whether the option contains an error
 *   - value      — returns the wrapped value, or throws if none is present
 *   - error      — returns the wrapped error, or throws if none is present
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is an OptionType.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::option
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/option.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-18
